    {
      "source": "Can be applied to methods of local services that involve heavy use\nof system resources, in a scenario where it is more efficient to\nthrottle concurrency for a specific service rather than restrict\nthe entire thread pool (for example, the web container's thread pool).",
      "translation": "可应用于涉及大量系统资源使用的本地服务方法，在针对特定服务限制并发比限制整个线程池（例如 Web 容器的线程池）更高效的场景中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default concurrency limit of this interceptor is 1.\nSpecify the \"concurrencyLimit\" bean property to change this value.",
      "translation": "此拦截器的默认并发限制为 1。请指定\"concurrencyLimit\"bean 属性来更改该值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a default <code>ConcurrencyThrottleInterceptor</code>\nwith concurrency limit 1.",
      "translation": "创建默认<code>ConcurrencyThrottleInterceptor</code>，并发限制为 1。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>ConcurrencyThrottleInterceptor</code>\nwith the given concurrency limit.",
      "translation": "创建具有给定并发限制的<code>ConcurrencyThrottleInterceptor</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
